This product contains code derived from the Image Biomarker Standardisation
Initiative (IBSI) reference implementations and guidelines.
https://theibsi.github.io/

The benchmark installs and evaluates third-party radiomics software in
separate environments. Those packages and the externally fetched IBSI data
remain subject to their own licenses; their provenance and license locations
are recorded in reproducibility/inputs/manifest.json and README.md.
